---
title: "refund (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check contract not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_stage: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert: revert Paused
    q_check_stage --> q_check_refunded: block.timestamp in refund period
    q_check_stage --> q_revert: revert InvalidStage
    q_check_refunded --> q_get_position: position.hasRefunded == false
    q_check_refunded --> q_revert: revert AlreadyRefunded
    q_get_position --> q_mark_refunded: capital = position.investedCapital
    q_mark_refunded --> q_update_total: position.hasRefunded = true
    q_update_total --> q_transfer: totalInvestedCapital -= capital
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(investor, capital), emit Refunded
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_mark_refunded
        INV-001: refund sets hasRefunded to true, preventing double refund
        INV-002: refund returns full investedCapital to investor
        INV-003: totalInvestedCapital decreases by exact refund amount
    end note

    note right of q_check_stage
        INV-004: refund only allowed during designated refund period
        INV-005: refund period is between endTime and refundEndTime
    end note
